{"seq":2,"slug":"high-risk-channel-govern","title":"高发渠道治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-governance/high-risk-channel-govern","wordCount":2239,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高发渠道治理\">高发渠道治理</h1><p>当趋势分析指向某个渠道差异率持续高于基线，接下来的问题不是&quot;怎么把它处理掉&quot;，而是&quot;<strong>谁该为它改变行为</strong>&quot;。跨境对账里差异的源头大多不在我方：渠道方的清算时点、费率文档更新节奏、文件字段规范、状态回传完整性都由对方控制。这意味着治理的核心能力是<strong>跨组织的缺陷推动</strong>——把统计信号转成对方能接受的、可验证的、有时限的缺陷描述，并跟踪到修复。这不是运营技巧，而是一套需要系统支撑的流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-渠道差异率的三层归因\">核心概念：渠道差异率的三层归因</h2><p>推动渠道修复的前提是分清&quot;差异率高于基线&quot;到底是哪一层的责任：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;渠道差异率高于基线&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;归因层&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;契约层&quot;| C[&quot;费率/口径约定不清&lt;br/&gt;合同与文档层面&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;接口层&quot;| D[&quot;字段/报文/时点&lt;br/&gt;技术对接层面&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;操作层&quot;| E[&quot;对账文件生成错误&lt;br/&gt;对方作业层面&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;推动:明确书面约定&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;推动:接口规范修订&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;推动:缺陷单 + 复现证据&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; I[&quot;验证期 + 指标目标&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J{&quot;达标？&quot;}&#10;  J --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| K[&quot;关闭专项&lt;br/&gt;回流基线&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| L[&quot;升级:商务/合规介入&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"渠道差异率高于基线\"] --&gt; B{\"归因层\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"契约层\"| C[\"费率/口径约定不清&lt;br/&gt;合同与文档层面\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"接口层\"| D[\"字段/报文/时点&lt;br/&gt;技术对接层面\"]\n  B --&gt;|\"操作层\"| E[\"对账文件生成错误&lt;br/&gt;对方作业层面\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"推动:明确书面约定\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"推动:接口规范修订\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"推动:缺陷单 + 复现证据\"]\n  F --&gt; I[\"验证期 + 指标目标\"]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J{\"达标？\"}\n  J --&gt;|\"是\"| K[\"关闭专项&lt;br/&gt;回流基线\"]\n  J --&gt;|\"否\"| L[\"升级:商务/合规介入\"]</pre><p>三层的区别很重要，因为推动方式完全不同：契约层问题需要的是把口头约定落到书面（并明确生效日）；接口层问题是技术规范缺失，通常对方愿意改且改得快；操作层问题是对方案件的 bug 或作业疏忽，需要提供可复现的证据才能让对方承认。<strong>用错层次会导致推动失败</strong>——拿操作层的证据去谈契约层的问题，对方会答复&quot;这不属于我们的承诺范围&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异率的可比性与渠道分组\">差异率的可比性与渠道分组</h2><h3 id=\"为什么不能直接比较渠道\">为什么不能直接比较渠道</h3><p>直接比较不同渠道的差异率会得到错误结论，因为渠道的构成差异极大：一个吃卡组织大额清算的渠道与一个处理 1 美元小额钱包充值的渠道，其&quot;每笔差异&quot;的绝对意义完全不同。因此治理实践中要做两件事：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可比性障碍</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>笔均金额差异大</td>\n<td>用<strong>金额加权</strong>的差异率与<strong>笔数</strong>差异率双口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务类型构成不同</td>\n<td>按业务类型分层后再比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币种不同（精度/点差不同）</td>\n<td>折算为统一币种，且对 0 位小数币种单独设阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>季节性因素</td>\n<td>与同类渠道的同期值比较，而非跨期比较</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>双口径的价值在于它们会指向不同结论。笔数口径高而金额口径低，说明是&quot;高频小额&quot;问题（典型是手续费分位舍入）；金额口径高而笔数口径低，说明是&quot;低频大额&quot;问题（典型是漏结算或整笔未到）。两者的修复动作完全不同——前者调费率表同步，后者查结算流程。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>rate_count</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>例外笔数</mtext><mtext>交易笔数</mtext></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>rate_amount</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>diff</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>amount</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rate\\_count} = \\frac{\\text{例外笔数}}{\\text{交易笔数}},\\qquad \\text{rate\\_amount} = \\frac{\\sum|\\text{diff}|}{\\sum \\text{amount}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9251em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate_count</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">交易笔数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">例外笔数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate_amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">amount</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diff</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"分组-把渠道归到同类\">分组：把渠道归到同类</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE channel_peer_group (&#10;  channel_code     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  peer_group       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  group_reason     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from   DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (channel_code, effective_from)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW v_channel_peer_outlier AS&#10;SELECT c.channel_code,&#10;       c.peer_group,&#10;       c.rate_count,&#10;       p.peer_median_rate,&#10;       round(c.rate_count / nullif(p.peer_median_rate, 0), 2) AS ratio_vs_peers&#10;FROM v_channel_rate_current c&#10;JOIN v_peer_group_median p ON p.peer_group = c.peer_group&#10;WHERE c.rate_count &gt; p.peer_median_rate * 2.0&#10;  AND c.exception_count &gt;= 30;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> channel_peer_group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  peer_group       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  group_reason     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (channel_code, effective_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> v_channel_peer_outlier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">peer_group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">peer_median_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">peer_median_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ratio_vs_peers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_channel_rate_current c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_peer_group_median p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">peer_group</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">peer_group</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">peer_median_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exception_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个条件缺一不可：<code>ratio_vs_peers &gt; 2</code> 保证是相对异常，<code>exception_count &gt;= 30</code> 保证样本量足够。只用前者会在小样本渠道上产生大量假告警——一个每月只有 12 笔交易的渠道偶尔出现 3 笔差异，比率就会远超同类。</p>\n<p><code>group_reason</code> 是有意设计的字段：它迫使分组决策带理由（&quot;同为卡组织收单，笔均金额区间 50–200 USD&quot;），而不是靠感觉把渠道随意归类。归组理由一变，历史比较的可比性就变了，这一点和 <a href=\"../exception-classify-match/long-short-transit-fee-fx\">长款/短款/在途/手续费/汇率差异</a> 里&quot;归一化规则必须带版本号&quot;是一样的道理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缺陷推动的流程与证据\">缺陷推动的流程与证据</h2><h3 id=\"缺陷单的必备字段\">缺陷单的必备字段</h3><p>向渠道方提缺陷，本质是一次跨组织的问题报告。它与内部工单的差别在于：对方没有义务理解你的上下文，所以证据必须自包含、可复现、且指向对方可控的行为。这与金融报文标准化的动机同源——ISO 20022 之所以把支付、清算、对账类报文抽象成统一的元数据仓库（消息与业务过程的可机读描述），正是因为跨机构往来必须依赖双方都能解释的规范定义，而不是各自的内部约定（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_20022\">ISO 20022</a>）。缺陷单里的&quot;期望行为&quot;字段应当引用这类双方共同承认的规范，而不是引用我方内部文档。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>内容要求</th>\n<th>反面示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>现象描述</td>\n<td>客观行为 + 首次出现日期</td>\n<td>&quot;你们的费率有问题&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复现证据</td>\n<td>至少 3 个独立样本，含双方记录的关键字段</td>\n<td>&quot;有很多笔对不上&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期望行为</td>\n<td>引用具体条款/规范/报文定义</td>\n<td>&quot;希望改进&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>影响量化</td>\n<td>笔数与金额（折算统一币种）</td>\n<td>&quot;影响很大&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>责任层</td>\n<td>契约层 / 接口层 / 操作层</td>\n<td>未标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时限</td>\n<td>期望回复日与期望修复日</td>\n<td>未给期限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;defect_id&quot;: &quot;CHD-2026-09-0027&quot;,&#10;  &quot;channel_code&quot;: &quot;CH_CARD_ACQ&quot;,&#10;  &quot;attribution_layer&quot;: &quot;interface&quot;,&#10;  &quot;first_seen&quot;: &quot;2026-09-18&quot;,&#10;  &quot;symptom&quot;: &quot;settlement file fee field omits cross-border surcharge for card_type=DEBIT_EU&quot;,&#10;  &quot;evidence_samples&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;our_txn&quot;: &quot;txn_1Pq7x2LkdIwHu7ix&quot;,&#10;      &quot;file_entry_ref&quot;: &quot;ENT-000183442&quot;,&#10;      &quot;file_fee_minor&quot;: 175,&#10;      &quot;expected_fee_minor&quot;: 189,&#10;      &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;our_txn&quot;: &quot;txn_1Pq7x9LkdIwHu7ix&quot;,&#10;      &quot;file_entry_ref&quot;: &quot;ENT-000183517&quot;,&#10;      &quot;file_fee_minor&quot;: 175,&#10;      &quot;expected_fee_minor&quot;: 189,&#10;      &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;our_txn&quot;: &quot;txn_1Pq8a1LkdIwHu7ix&quot;,&#10;      &quot;file_entry_ref&quot;: &quot;ENT-000183902&quot;,&#10;      &quot;file_fee_minor&quot;: 175,&#10;      &quot;expected_fee_minor&quot;: 189,&#10;      &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;expected_behavior&quot;: &quot;per rate card v2026-09 effective 2026-09-15, surcharge included in fee field&quot;,&#10;  &quot;impact&quot;: { &quot;exception_count_30d&quot;: 4187, &quot;amount_minor_30d&quot;: 5861800, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot; },&#10;  &quot;requested_reply_by&quot;: &quot;2026-10-02&quot;,&#10;  &quot;requested_fix_by&quot;: &quot;2026-10-15&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"defect_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CHD-2026-09-0027\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"channel_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CH_CARD_ACQ\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"attribution_layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"interface\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"first_seen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-18\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"symptom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"settlement file fee field omits cross-border surcharge for card_type=DEBIT_EU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_samples\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"our_txn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"txn_1Pq7x2LkdIwHu7ix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"file_entry_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ENT-000183442\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"file_fee_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">175</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"expected_fee_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">189</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"our_txn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"txn_1Pq7x9LkdIwHu7ix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"file_entry_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ENT-000183517\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"file_fee_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">175</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"expected_fee_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">189</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"our_txn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"txn_1Pq8a1LkdIwHu7ix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"file_entry_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ENT-000183902\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"file_fee_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">175</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"expected_fee_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">189</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expected_behavior\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per rate card v2026-09 effective 2026-09-15, surcharge included in fee field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"impact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"exception_count_30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4187</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount_minor_30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5861800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"requested_reply_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"requested_fix_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-15\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>evidence_samples</code> 里的 <code>expected_fee_minor</code> 必须能追溯到权威来源（这里是费率卡版本），否则对方会以&quot;无法确认你的期望值&quot;为由拒绝。这是缺陷推动里最常失败的一环：能描述差异，但无法给出期望行为的权威依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分级推动与升级路径\">分级推动与升级路径</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>时限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>常规沟通</td>\n<td>缺陷单提交</td>\n<td>对接人跟进</td>\n<td>5 工作日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级 1</td>\n<td>超期无回复</td>\n<td>对接人上级 + 渠道客户经理</td>\n<td>5 工作日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级 2</td>\n<td>超期或答复不接受</td>\n<td>商务介入，纳入合作评估</td>\n<td>10 工作日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级 3</td>\n<td>持续恶化</td>\n<td>财务/合规介入，考虑替代方案</td>\n<td>视影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>升级路径必须提前定义并让对方知道。这看起来是&quot;软&quot;流程，实际效果差别很大——<strong>一个明确了升级阶梯的缺陷单，回复率显著高于没有阶梯的</strong>，因为对方知道拖下去的成本是可预期的。升级之所以有效，本质上是把&quot;沉默不作为&quot;也纳入了一条会被记录、会被计时的路径，这与 <a href=\"../case-investigation-sla/case-sla-escalation\">工单 SLA 与升级</a> 中把层级升级建模成责任人链变更是同一个机制。</p>\n<p>需要强调边界：这里推动的是&quot;对方履约与规范符合&quot;，不涉及索赔谈判。因渠道差错造成的资金损失如何追偿（转应收、对账差异索赔）属于 <a href=\"../suspense-writeoff/writeoff-approval-control\">核销审批与权限</a> 里 <code>recover_from_channel</code> 动作的范畴，两者在同一张缺陷单上关联但流程不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治理动作回流到规则\">治理动作回流到规则</h2><p>渠道治理的最终产出不只是&quot;渠道修好了&quot;，还包括<strong>本侧规则的修订</strong>。三类回流：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>治理结论</th>\n<th>回流目标</th>\n<th>具体动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>差额确认不可回收</td>\n<td>容差阈值</td>\n<td>上调该渠道手续费差异的容差档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>某类差异确认是时间差</td>\n<td>观察窗</td>\n<td>重新标定该渠道的窗口长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>某类差异确认必须人工</td>\n<td>硬规则</td>\n<td>新增硬规则，无视容差强制建单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二条最容易漏。当清算时点漂移被识别（见 <a href=\"exception-trend-rootcause\">差异趋势与根因分析</a> 中的识别信号），如果不重新标定窗口，系统会开始把在途误判为真差异，例外量虚增——<strong>治理了一个真实缺陷，却制造了一个流程缺陷</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE governance_action (&#10;  action_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  defect_id     TEXT,&#10;  action_type   TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (action_type IN&#10;                  (&#39;tolerance_change&#39;,&#39;window_recalibrate&#39;,&#39;hard_rule_add&#39;,&#39;process_change&#39;)),&#10;  target_ref    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  from_value    TEXT,&#10;  to_value      TEXT,&#10;  effective_date DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  verified_at   DATE,&#10;  verified_metric TEXT,&#10;  state         TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;planned&#39;&#10;                  CHECK (state IN (&#39;planned&#39;,&#39;applied&#39;,&#39;verified&#39;,&#39;reverted&#39;))&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> governance_action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  action_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  defect_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  action_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (action_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tolerance_change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'window_recalibrate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hard_rule_add'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'process_change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  from_value    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  to_value      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verified_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verified_metric </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'planned'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'planned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'applied'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'verified'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reverted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>state</code> 包含 <code>reverted</code> 是刻意的：治理动作可能做错（容差上调过多、窗口设置过长），必须有一等公民的回退状态，而不是靠偷偷改回去。这与规则必须可审计的要求一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"专项治理周期的节奏\">专项治理周期的节奏</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>周期</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每周</td>\n<td>更新渠道异常列表与缺陷单状态</td>\n<td>渠道健康周报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每月</td>\n<td>专项复盘：达标关闭 / 未达标升级</td>\n<td>关闭或升级决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每季</td>\n<td>规则回流批量执行 + 效果验证</td>\n<td>规则修订版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每半年</td>\n<td>渠道分层重评估（是否仍属同类）</td>\n<td>分组表更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>半年的渠道分层重评估不是形式。渠道的业务量、业务结构会随时间变化，一个两年前与另一渠道同类的渠道可能已经完全不同质，继续放在同组比较会产生错误的告警或错误的平静。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>渠道差异率按契约层 / 接口层 / 操作层三层归因，层的选择决定了推动方式；用错层会导致推动失败。</li>\n<li>渠道不可直接比较：用笔数与金额双口径、按业务类型分层、按分组与同类比；分组要记录 <code>group_reason</code>。</li>\n<li>缺陷单必须自包含：现象、至少 3 个样本、可追溯的权威期望值、量化影响、明确时限；缺&quot;权威期望值&quot;是最常见的失败点。</li>\n<li>治理结论要回流到本侧规则（容差、观察窗、硬规则），其中观察窗重标定最易被遗漏，漏掉会把已修的缺陷变成流程缺陷。</li>\n<li>治理动作表要有一等的 <code>reverted</code> 状态；渠道分组每半年重评估。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所有治理结论最终要在一处持续可见——见 <a href=\"exception-quality-dashboard\">例外处理质量看板</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高发渠道治理","id":"高发渠道治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：渠道差异率的三层归因","id":"核心概念-渠道差异率的三层归因"},{"level":2,"text":"差异率的可比性与渠道分组","id":"差异率的可比性与渠道分组"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不能直接比较渠道","id":"为什么不能直接比较渠道"},{"level":3,"text":"分组：把渠道归到同类","id":"分组-把渠道归到同类"},{"level":2,"text":"缺陷推动的流程与证据","id":"缺陷推动的流程与证据"},{"level":3,"text":"缺陷单的必备字段","id":"缺陷单的必备字段"},{"level":3,"text":"分级推动与升级路径","id":"分级推动与升级路径"},{"level":2,"text":"治理动作回流到规则","id":"治理动作回流到规则"},{"level":2,"text":"专项治理周期的节奏","id":"专项治理周期的节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"差异趋势与根因分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-governance/exception-trend-rootcause"},"next":{"title":"例外处理质量看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-governance/exception-quality-dashboard"}}